Escolar para la Escuela ''Vicente de la Torre''" y desarrollado en el marco del
PNF en Informática, consiste en el diseño e implementación de un software
local basado en PHP y MySQL para automatizar y centralizar los registros
administrativos y estudiantiles de dicha institución. Su objetivo principal es
optimizar el control de inscripciones, asistencias y calificaciones, sustituyendo
los procesos manuales en físico para mitigar la pérdida de documentos, agilizar
las consultas del personal directivo y facilitar la toma de decisiones mediante
reportes estadísticos automatizados.', 1, 'ESCUELA “VICENTE DE LA TORRE', '', '2026-10-19 23:01:57.547376', NULL, NULL, 'Implementar un sistema de gestión local escolar para la Escuela “Vicente de la Torre” como como respaldo de información y automatización de esta, lo que facilitara el trabajo del secretario(a) al momento de hacer estadísticas e inscripción de los estudiantes.', true, '[-0.05711533,0.12212064,0.02162302,-0.06067227,-0.04974387,-0.1308408,0.06524276,0.09691452,0.02266844,0.03372777,-0.05762033,0.03092773,0.07470724,-0.06051424,-0.03189726,0.01340101,-0.06064126,0.04854455,0.10966588,0.00121211,0.00226191,-0.0315461,-0.01614346,0.05936696,-0.00859503,0.07346474,0.04029323,0.06116412,0.06507444,-0.03962786,-0.05349486,-0.00477108,0.0587699,0.00115202,0.01066943,0.1298562,0.07086656,0.00857721,-0.00295563,-0.02120145,-0.01820698,-0.04709567,-0.00143674,-0.02084085,0.0690545,0.01241234,0.01029985,-0.02276657,-0.05508193,-0.05980285,-0.00026973,0.02002387,0.03718992,-0.06306674,0.03465959,0.07936706,0.12824272,-0.01716019,0.05619484,0.01231166,-0.14590222,0.0919963,-0.03231327,0.02364735,0.03601808,0.14535636,-0.02407775,-0.01244376,0.07829791,-0.01140835,0.1114467,-0.00119786,-0.00091114,0.06618722,-0.01294223,0.01737673,-0.02265387,0.01231444,-0.00221625,0.01546781,0.0527632,-0.01979582,0.05933624,-0.01281107,0.06040774,-0.02966266,-0.04777841,0.01706626,0.00964601,0.05901385,0.05304591,-0.00966645,0.01458376,0.06384104,-0.06124861,0.02547667,-0.00824502,-0.12784377,-0.0787206,0.0521627,-0.06232448,0.03319366,-0.04074515,0.01242032,0.0215492,-0.01049078,0.00014957,-0.02280183,-0.00727086,-0.12268161,-0.01976618,-0.03677289,-0.00950351,-0.00354823,-0.00898365,-0.03070423,0.02360105,0.03765761,-0.04115621,-0.08413844,0.06595548,0.00946026,-0.08273392,-0.05326759,0.02727004,0.04783667,-0.07241074,0.014533,0.00934856,-0.02748356,-0.02349521,0.05701536,-0.04942361,-0.05385818,0.04413756,0.02095327,0.05321573,-0.05810345,0.07089071,0.0156384,-0.0295017,0.038