Dicho estudio se fundamenta en la metodología de Investigación-Acción Participativa (IAP), permitiendo una interacción directa entre los investigadores y la organización, con el fin de identificar problemas reales, diseñar una propuesta tecnológica adecuada y aplicar soluciones efectivas orientadas al mejoramiento continuo.

La investigación aborda un diagnóstico situacional, la identificación de necesidades, el análisis de alternativas de solución y el desarrollo de un sistema automatizado para la gestión integral de inventarios, facturación, clientes y órdenes de producción. La implementación del sistema permitirá reducir errores, centralizar la información, optimizar tiempos de respuesta y aumentar la productividad empresarial.

Finalmente, se espera que el proyecto contribuya al fortalecimiento tecnológico de INME C.A., mejore su capacidad competitiva en el mercado nacional y sirva como modelo de referencia para otras organizaciones con necesidades similares de transformación digital', 1, 'INME C.A', '', '2026-10-19 23:04:04.194917', NULL, NULL, 'Desarrollar un sistema de gestión de inventario web para la empresa INME C.', true, '[-0.07003092,0.05983923,0.05658667,0.03236613,0.02854728,-0.08091858,0.04593683,0.02801914,-0.03391097,0.00510152,-0.02300331,0.00463387,-0.03307567,-0.0230988,-0.05689853,0.04333774,-0.05270219,-0.05787473,0.0216141,0.04890897,-0.12111026,-0.03218706,0.02943062,-0.0323774,-0.0993142,-0.01837417,0.02407107,0.0219129,0.00986763,-0.04819812,-0.00615548,0.07711441,0.03599259,0.07782378,0.00032575,-0.00754486,-0.00971247,0.01296417,-0.00930694,-0.02689767,-0.01442325,-0.10787984,0.0258911,-0.08262323,0.02065538,-0.00827837,0.07965707,-0.06832787,0.00769602,0.07746249,-0.12220614,0.01411588,0.06251523,-0.02163597,0.07462516,0.01344885,0.01847836,-0.08847936,0.00785197,0.02678886,0.07434632,-0.04389194,-0.01751617,0.00232109,0.14320114,0.01725526,-0.04487253,0.06643519,-0.00130171,0.02486657,0.08326624,0.01165877,-0.08545988,0.12396686,-0.04018686,-0.02263461,0.0479187,-0.04449542,0.0118566,0.02276111,-0.02418788,-0.00330109,0.01417634,0.01430015,-0.07356677,-0.01933789,0.01238593,0.01196384,-0.06253765,0.05125394,0.02165829,-0.04541018,-0.03478066,0.01451028,0.00310512,0.03344113,-0.03011843,-0.00922774,-0.02707627,0.0243194,0.00386785,0.04991471,-0.0544117,-0.04829258,0.02518212,-0.01481851,-0.00412062,0.03026661,0.00476745,-0.05794546,-9.865e-05,-0.00900871,-0.01376402,-0.0384621,0.01885927,0.03239652,0.02916574,0.0349099,0.02659591,-0.0665012,0.03296493,0.05990525,0.11121394,0.09842661,-0.035465,0.00612494,-0.04102393,-0.0580538,-0.03074473,-0.01897707,0.02227732,0.00721039,-0.00642691,0.03647163,0.04983615,0.046142,0.00184914,0.00583186,-0.03563186,-0.01995908,0.04